$ pxo export --help
exit 0
--- stdout
Write the document as an image

Arguments:
  out  text; output file; the format comes from its extension (.png)

Usage:
  pixopher export <out> [flags]

Examples:
  pxo export hero.png --scale 8
  pxo export hero.pxo out/hero@4x.png --scale 4 --json

Flags:
  -f, --file string   document to act on (default: $PIXOPHER_FILE, the file set by use, or the only *.pxo here)
  -h, --help          help for export
      --rgba          write truecolor even with 256 colors or fewer
      --scale int     integer nearest-neighbor upscale, 1 to 64 (default 1)

Global Flags:
      --json   machine-readable output (PIXOPHER_JSON=1 turns it on everywhere)

